{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17102600","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17102600","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1710260001:0":{"text":"근위대원님, 제발 도와주세요!","source_cn":"救命！守备军大人！请帮帮我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE676A18E4C3AAE8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710260002:0":{"text":"무슨 일입니까?","source_cn":"怎么了？发生什么事了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x975AEFEC1869DCA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710260003:0":{"text":"저희 주인님이! 주인님이 사라지셨어요!","source_cn":"我的主人！我的主人不见了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A6E6E5DA4ACC82E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710260004:0":{"text":"방금 주인님을 모시고 시장에서 나와서 <style=\"highlight\">상층 지구의 저택</style>으로 돌아가려고 했는데요...","source_cn":"我们刚从集市出来准备返回<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FD90260AC34999C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710260005:0":{"text":"가, 갑자기 사라지셨어요! 뭔가 보이지 않는 것이... 순식간에 잡아채 간 것처럼요!","source_cn":"然后、然后他突然就不见了！就像……就像被什么看不见的东...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25B16024FAF74364","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1710260005":{"text":"가, 갑자기 사라지셨어요! 뭔가 보이지 않는 것이... 순식간에 잡아채 간 것처럼요!","source_cn":"然后、然后他突然就不见了！就像……就像被什么看不见的东西一把拽走了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25B16024FAF74364","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710260006:0":{"text":"전혀요! 조금 전까지는 분명 계셨는데, 눈 깜짝할 사이에 사라지셨다니까요!","source_cn":"没有！什么都没有！前一秒还在，下一秒人就没了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE80BDFAAC7FF9B9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710260007:0":{"text":"우선 진정하십시오! 당신의 주인이 누굽니까?","source_cn":"冷静！告诉我你的主人是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7239447193550842","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710260008:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">내무 차관</style>, 우서스 자작님이세요!","source_cn":"我的主人是乌瑟斯子爵，<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECC5C32385EAE575","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710260009:0":{"text":"제발 저희 주인님 좀 찾아주세요!","source_cn":"大人，求求你们一定要找到我的主人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1349E332C789EDFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}